/-!
# Q4M raw evaluator traces for Boolean form 2 (generated by scripts/gen_lean.py)

Each segment theorem evaluates one round of the quad helper on arbitrary
256-bit stack words with `Stepper.runInstr`; the composition theorem chains
them into the before-jump template.
-/

